{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 90812, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 63563, "uid": 42813, "type": 4, "title": "Raid日记", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1635480460, "updated_at": 1638099407, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1638099407, "last_at": 1657542444, "comment_count": 25, "status": 1, "summary": "11.25关于30车要点：注意boss伤害。考虑到玩家群体中火伞、鲁邦的保有量，这次raid斩车难度应该不高，“队伍伤害够但是会暴毙”应该会成为大多数人的问题。阵容：最优阵容为火伞+对策+火人鱼+火弓", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262091220_82726266.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262091220_5935894.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262091219_89441329.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 28, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 29924, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 1, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 90812, "content": "<div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">11.25</span></span><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(75,82,91);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">关于30车</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"></span></span></span></span></p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">要点：注意boss伤害。考虑到玩家群体中火伞、鲁邦的保有量，这次raid斩车难度应该不高，“队伍伤害够但是会暴毙”应该会成为大多数人的问题。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">阵容：最优阵容为<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/23840.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">火伞</a><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">+</span><a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/92652.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">对策</a><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">+</span><a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/60169.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">火人鱼</a><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">+</span><a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/57135.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">火弓</a><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">+</span><a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/77369.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">鲁邦</a>。不过不是很推荐，因为我用的时候虽然两分半斩车了，但是鲁邦也倒了。如果用这套阵容斩不了车，①可将火弓换海王星，虽然伤害会低但至少能打满5分钟；②将一名辅助替换为<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/20755.html\" target=\"_blank\">圣诞勒达</a>（技能预约S），不建议换对策。</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">另外没有火人鱼可以考虑鲜花（T-S），没有火弓可以考虑海王星（S）。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">通用技能预约：火伞T-S（满点火情况，下简称U）或 S 或 T；对策S-T 或 S-T-T（U）；火人鱼<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">S-T 或 S-T-T（U）；火弓S；鲁邦<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">S-T 或 S-T-T（U）。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">DS顺序：①三循环。对策DS三回合的应援一般情况下可以做到全程覆盖，推荐放一号位。三号位首选鲁邦，次选火弓。二号位比较随意，火人鱼最优。示例：对策-火人鱼-鲁邦；对策-火人鱼-火弓（鲁邦换勒达）；对策-鲜花-鲁邦（火人鱼换鲜花）。②双循环。一般不采用双循环，除非没有优质三号位，比如没上鲁邦嫌火弓DS的30%增伤太低时，可以考虑对策-火人鱼看能不能冲4FT。另外在缺乏生存能力时，考虑频繁释放勒达DS。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">魂卡：刀就用<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/60242.html\" target=\"_blank\">爱恋的开始</a>或者<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/57113.html\" target=\"_blank\">重振旗鼓</a>，对火伞来说，普+4爱恋应≥闪+5重振旗鼓。火辅助首选<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/92654.html\" target=\"_blank\">新魂卡</a>＞<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/21011.html\" target=\"_blank\">南瓜卡</a>＞其他血防魂卡，其他属性辅助则是首选南瓜卡。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">补充：Leader一般给对策就行。前三攻个人建议刀、对策、火人鱼，不过关系不大。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">题外话：这次的30车确实挺有人性，日服当时是有-80%暴击率的，国际服没有，再加上对策比较强力，可以说斩车压力比较小。不过</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">看了眼RB技能，我感觉要暴毙，准备好海王星、圣诞勒达甚至火教皇/花奶。</span></div></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line4\"></div></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\">11.10</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(75,82,91);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">关于RB防御力</span></p></div></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第二层1550左右。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第三层1595左右。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">第四层1625左右。</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第五层1655左右。</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第六层1700左右。</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第七层1735左右。</span><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;目前看下来没有规律，反正每层都会高一点，第八层晚上应该能摸到，这也是我的极限了。</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第八层1780左右。&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></div></span></div></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\">11.7</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">关于RB防御力</span></p></div></span><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;起因是看到moot上这篇<a href=\"https://moot.us/lounges/240/boards/1154/posts/5428312\" target=\"_blank\">帖子</a>，决定测试一下。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第二层防御力1550左右。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第三层还没打到。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">关于RB血量</span></span></span></p></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;同样是看到那篇帖子，记录一下。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">RB血量</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;46,174,317</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;57,815,538</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;69,174,031</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;80,206,369</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;91,190,289</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">6&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;102,151,764</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;113,114,870</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">8&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;124,100,939</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">9&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;135,133,572</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">10&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;146,230,432</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">11&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;157,416,825</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">12&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;168,726,383</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">13&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;180,172,172</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">14&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;191,768,588</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">15&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;203,540,779</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">16&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;215,519,610</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">17&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;227,725,716</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">18&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;240,185,075</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">19&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;252,894,996</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">20&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;265,933,740</span></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(75,82,91);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">关于RB增益</span></span></span></p></div><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;注意其中有一栏全体盟友的Tap Skill伤害+应是Tap Skill最终伤害+，官方文本错误。<div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">记录</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262084065_68916688.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262084065_68916688.jpg\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 778px;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262087387_14428734.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262087387_14428734.jpg\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 778px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262091218_1067593.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262091218_1067593.jpg\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 778px;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262091219_89441329.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262091219_89441329.jpg\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 778px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262091220_5935894.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262091220_5935894.jpg\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 778px;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262091220_82726266.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262091220_82726266.jpg\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 778px;\"></div></div>\n                               </div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(75,82,91);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">关于RB中计算公式</span></span></span></p></div><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 与普通raid的30车不同，“<b style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;\">（1+额外增伤<font color=\"#ff0000\" style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">+战场补正+策划补正</font>）</b>”（详见<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/52136.html\" target=\"_blank\">此贴</a>）此项中：战场补正无论何时都取0，即使是弱点情况下（原来在弱点时+0.4）；<span style=\"\">策划补正非弱点时取-0.7，其余情况取0。</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span><br></span></span></div></span></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">10.30</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(75,82,91);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">关于RB第一层</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"></span></span></span></span></p></div></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;一些基本情况之前已经记录。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;防御力没测，不过和30车应该差不多，我方伤害会变高是因为有RB增益。boss最棘手的技能是退条，让我方难以放出DS与FT，没有什么特别好的应对方法，上一些奇怪的辅助伤害不见得会变高，不过减益回避魂卡+减益回避附魔应该是有帮助的。目前已知最有效的应对方法就是手操，普通玩家建议以放出一次FT为目标，比较熟练、有技术的玩家应该能放出两次甚至更多FT。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(75,82,91);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\">关于RB第二~？层</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"></span></span></span></span></p></div></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;包括boss技能、防御力在内大部分情况与第一层一致，但是DS伤害貌似变高了。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第二层血量57815538。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br></span></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line4\"></div><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">10.29</span></span><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">关于30车</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\"></span></span></span></span></p></div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">要点：我方会有战场buff暴击率-80%&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">阵容：我推荐使用<span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">普巴/对策+光兔子/木莫娜+海王星/光双刃+A+B</span>的队伍。A与B建议在光莫娜、鲜花、熊妹（至少三红）/猫耳尼曼（至少三红）中三选二。如果刀是普巴，可以上鲁邦，有用的技能是FT前置DS和TS觉醒。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">我使用的阵容（最快大概4分钟斩车）</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635482544321_69112862.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635482544321_69112862.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 728px;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635482663359_52513145.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635482663359_52513145.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 728px;\"><br><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">boss技能记录</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635483406379_24601588.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635483406379_24601588.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 728px;\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">关于RB第一层</span></p></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">要点：</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">①我方战场增益有</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">暴击率-80%、吸血无效，敌人skill量表充能速度+80%，全体敌人弱化减益及时间系减益无效。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">②经过测试boss伤害略高。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">③武器附魔效果为伤害转化为回复，因此不受吸血无效影响。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">④boss的SS技能非常变态，可以削除我方40%的DS槽（对3名敌人应该是判定3次），具体表现是可能打完5分钟放不出一个FT，因此配队可以不考虑FT伤害。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">阵容：与30车相比基本不变，建议上海王星，鲁邦基本不考虑。此层普巴与对策表现差不多。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">我使用的阵容</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635483165209_608010.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635483165209_608010.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 728px;\"></div></div>\n                               </div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">boss技能记录</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635483487129_68670504.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635483487129_68670504.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 728px;\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><br></span></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">为什么会有这个帖？</span></span></span></p></div><br></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">我将不再写预攻略。预攻略并不总是有参考性，其依据大多来源于日服的经验，而至今好几次国际服的实际情况都与预期（日服）有一定出入。为了避免误导与做无用功，我不愿意继续写预攻略，今后都会在活动开始后一天左右的时间更新“正式攻略”，主要是分享我认为比较适合的队伍和我使用的队伍，以及一些活动的注意点。</span></span></span></span></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262091220_82726266.jpg", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262091220_5935894.jpg", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636262091219_89441329.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 42813, "username": "不再年轻了", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/1.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 26, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 18, "read_num": 378323, "like_num": 292}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_imag